Third-party components in Forever Guides
========================================

LibDeflate 1.0.2
  Path:    ForeverGuides/Libs/LibDeflate/
  Author:  Haoqian He
  License: zlib License, full text in ForeverGuides/Libs/LibDeflate/LICENSE.txt
  Source:  https://github.com/safeteeWow/LibDeflate
  Changed: yes (all marked "Altered by Forever Guides" in the file).
           1. The last lines hand the library to the addon namespace
              instead of creating the global "LibDeflate".
           2. The copy is private: it is not registered with LibStub and
              does not defer to a copy from another addon.
           3. DecompressDeflate(str, max_output) stops with status -20 once
              more than max_output bytes would be produced (protection
              against decompression bombs). Without the argument the
              behavior is unchanged.

Fonts
  No font files are bundled, the addon uses the game's own fonts.

Game assets
  Icons and textures referenced by path (Interface\Icons\..., Interface\
  Buttons\..., Fonts\...) belong to the game client and are not bundled.